# What Did They Just Say? A Performance Improvement Journey through Nomenclature

**Authors:** Stephens, Alicia R.

## Abstract
A domestic credit union engages in a systematic performance improvement plan to better leverage a technical application within its organization. By engaging stakeholders early in the process, standardizing the organization's nomenclature, and building strategic partnerships, the credit union was able to achieve both quantitative and qualitative benchmarks of success.

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ979886

